Regression, old code caught API errors and returned translated messages:
```
// Old behavior
.catch((error) => {
  console.log(error);
  throw new Error(
    i18n.global.t('pageServerPowerOperations.toast.errorSaveSettings'),
  );
});
```

This would be better handled in a mutation's `onError`.

